{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/375803-setting-stuff-alternate-reality-shards","id":375803,"title":"Setting Stuff - Alternate Reality Shards","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-19T20:16:14-08:00","id":375803,"title":"Setting Stuff - Alternate Reality Shards","content":"<span style=\"font-size:28px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">So for my Demon game, instead of sharding into different loops of stable time, I'd like my Demons to have to deal with different loops of potential time, moving at the same rate, but with branching potentialities, used as experimental sites for the Machine. What follows are a few takes, as well as some of my notes - I'd love to hear some ideas out of the sounding board here for other Floridas.</span><br /> <br /> Alternate Floridas</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u201cControl has taken note of three zone transition events in the previous eight hours. Recommended action is resetting the entire southeast region approximately ten seconds.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Where the Sidewalk Ends</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">The Florida metro that crosses Tampa, Orlando, and Miami is a world of alternates; paths not taken, choices not made, and worlds only dreamed of in fevered imaginations. Where Seattle's shards are ahead or behind the times, most of the shards accessible through the strange doorways in Florida are could-have-beens and might-well-bes.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Supernatural Awareness</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">In worlds with humans, changing fates often reveal the presence of unnatural manipulations. It should be noted that awareness is not saturation \u2013 a world could very well be a perfect facsimile of the real world in which all methods of enacting any kind of physical change are contracts, but the inhabitants be completely unaware, possibly even of each other.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">None: There is no supernatural presence or knowledge at all other than the Machine and its agents, and humanity is essentially completely unaware of it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u25cf: There are a few people who know a few things, but knowledge, true knowledge, of the supernatural is largely held by inhuman things and the odd cult. If there is a supernatural presence at all, these shards quickly move to Awareness \u25cf\u25cf almost as soon as photography or audio recording is invented, and certainly move up once there are devices that can detect the movement and flow of subatomic particles and energies.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u25cf\u25cf: Some people know, a lot of people suspect something is very wrong, and hunter cells form regularly to do something about it. There's a lot of information on the internet, but for the most part, supernaturals don't talk to each other and they certainly don't talk to humans about anything. This is assumed to be the \u201cdefault\u201d level of the World of Darkness. It can easily move to stage \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf if there's a particularly nasty breakdown of any of the barrier worlds or an information age breaks out. This can be a smooth transition or a sudden and abrupt one.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf: Beings from Shadow wander the streets at night, the average person on the street knows what to do if assaulted by a supernatural being. Learning the occult is like getting a college degree \u2013 everyone's heard of it, and they might have a cousin who works on strange energies or something, but for the most part, it doesn't interfere with the culture too much, it's just known.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf: Goblin markets sometimes take place out in the open, during the day, and cops or the National Guard are trained to repel Arcadian beings and other such entities. Supernatural news is often the highlight of the day. The culture is built or being built around this knowledge. These types of shards move to stage \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf if there is any kind of infrastructure collapse or cultural reconstruction from a transition out of stage \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf awareness.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf: Goblin markets are the rule, not the exception. Bizarre things from Shadow or the Hedge are as normal as any other citizen. Everyone claims they know a guy who knows a guy that can decide what the rules of reality are at any moment. Magic is so integrated into society that there is very little cultural difference between \u201cmagic\u201d and \u201cnot magic.\u201d In fact, the concept of \u201cantimagic\u201d or \u201cdispelling\u201d things might not even exist.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><u><b>Nuked Orlando</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Point of Divergence: Sometime in October, 1962</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Supernatural Awareness: \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">In October of 1962, Russia placed a series of ballistic missiles in Cuba, and while post-negotiations it was agreed that Russia would dismantle the weapons, a frustrated Castro ordered the weapons fired, which resulted in a wide-scale exchange. This Florida is nearly completely retaken by its natural environment, and is dotted with sandhill, scrub, and oak hammock. There is a small settlement named Solace where Sanford is in baseline. It's a good sort of place to lie low while waiting for heat to die down, from, say, holding up a Krystal so you can use the angel repair facility in the back.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><u><b>Dinosaur World</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Point of Divergence: About 65 million years ago</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Supernatural Awareness: None</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">On baseline, sixty-five million years ago, an asteroid impact in Chicxulub resulted in the extinction of the non-avialan Dinosaurs. In Dinosaur World, this mass extinction did not occur. While most plant life continues to be recognizable as modern, there are no easily-notable modern species of animal. The megafauna of Florida consists of a wide variety of heavily modified Cretaceous landforms, from flightless Azhdarchids, active dromaeosaurs, and to an omnivorous ceratopsian species referred to as the \u201clocal boar.\u201d The area is only interesting because it has a mortal human settlement from a sharded Earth nearby that may or may not be baseline in the approximate geographical location of the downtown Orlando Public Library. The shard here inserts from the flyover at 17-92 and 436 right into a lake just north of that area.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><u><b>Oloyaindo</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Point of Divergence: Around 1347</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Supernatural Awarness: \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">On this shard, the Black Death managed to wipe out around three-fourths the population of Europe, rather than around a third, killing almost any kind of trade across the Atlantic. The Mexica Triple Alliance and the Mississippian complex have formed into rather large nations using Florida as a trading hub for exploration east into Europe and Africa. Oloyaindo is a large city and general tourist destination due to its nature as centralized point for culture in North and South America, in addition to greater Asia. Death Gods are a fact of life among the nachtin\u00e9 (\u201call of us\u201d), as well as magicians and religious practitioners of many varieties. Oloyaindo is a center for scientific research and investigation, leaning toward what other Earths might call the more esoteric expressions of science.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><u><b>EPCOT Metro</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Point of Divergence: Summer 1965</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Supernatural Awareness: \u25cf\u25cf</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">In this shard, a mysterious backer (collectively believed to be the God-Machine) awarded Walt Disney with the money required to build \u201cThe Florida Project\u201d - Experimental Prototype Community of Tomorrow, also known as EPCOT - to his vision and specification, before the Magic Kingdom. The modular city so constructed continued to be a driving force for technological prowess, and the entire metro region is an experimental testbed for all sorts of infrastructure and social systems. Most of the city is covered in smartglass and robots are a common sight on the streets. Nearly everything swarms with the God-Machine's influence. It's easier for a demon to be compromised in this Orlando, but it's also the sort of place where higher and faster gains against God can be made.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","user":"raygungoth","date":". 01-19-2015, 11:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T13:04:57-08:00","id":376565,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Moorlando</b></u><br /> Point of Divergence: Summer 716<br /> Supernatural Awareness: \u25cf\u25cf<br /> In this shard, a small army led by Pelagius was nearly defeated by an Umayyad army in the in the mountains of Iberia, and was allowed to establish a small christian town in Asturias. The rest of the Reconquista met with simi<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">lar failures, largely due to lack of leadership and centralized ambition. The series of conflicts that lead to the Moorish revitalization of Iberia also lead to a stronger, more centralized Moorish base of power in the peninsula, and it is Islamic ships that sail in the 1490s seeking a new route to a new world. Now the Islamic World Alliance operates much of the southeastern North America, along with the Mexica Triple Alliance, and while the age of Conquesta has long past, the people of the New Covadonga have built a newer, more secular government still plagued and ruled by its Islamic forebearers.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","user":"raygungoth","date":". 01-22-2015, 04:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T03:34:31-08:00","id":377931,"title":"","content":"this looks awesome, keep up the good work =]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T09:21:07-08:00","id":378128,"title":"","content":"Anything to do with my homeworld is neat, and so are alternate histories! Keep up the good work!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T13:27:03-08:00","id":378337,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u><b>Biolando</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Point of Divergence: Between 0.2 and 1.7 million years ago</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Supernatural Awareness: \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf (but see below)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">In baseline, humanity achieved control of fire before the introduction of <i>sapiens</i>; at some point in this shard, that practice was either abandoned or never occurred, but this shard is the site of multiple domestication events triggered by the emergence of psychic ability in several early human species. Over the course of the evolution of <i>sapiens</i>, selective breeding and manipulation of genetic material has led to a cultural revolution in which the history of the world is encoded in a vast memetic entity that essentially rules the equatorial regions of the planet. This entity directly opposes the God-Machine and almost anything created by its ministrations \u2013 the human culture is well-aware of multiple shards and that they are living in a pocket shard created by accident. The Hotel currently considers it a no-go zone, but there might be some secrets here where God openly wars against the hives.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T13:51:54-08:00","id":378347,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Teslando</b></u></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Point of Divergence: Around 1900</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Supernatural Awareness: \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">In this shard, Nikola Tesla met and married Anne Morgan while working for J.P. Morgan, and with access to the Morgan fortune and Anne's assistance, managed to overcome his own innate resistance to charity and personal interaction, and together they built an empire of steel and glass. Early adoption of wireless power led directly to the proliferation of nuclear energy in the 1940s and a much deadlier World War II. Currently, airships still plow through the skies and computing technology, while not miniaturized, saturates as much of the world as it does in baseline. Companies founded by Tesla on behalf of Thomas Edison have managed to prove the existence of Twilight, and several hunter agencies openly work for the police force. While they are unaware of the God-Machine, residents of this shard have recently become aware of traffic in and out of their universe.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T18:04:17-08:00","id":378554,"title":"","content":"<b>Bit of the Old In-And-Out</b><br /> Some shards have access to technologies or resources that aren't available in others. These could be anything from stable rocketpacks to arm-mounted nonlethal resin spraying barnacle guns, and they understandably perk eyebrows when they're utilized or demonstrated. Most of these items cause compromise rolls when they're flashed around, and definitely cause compromise rolls or straight up Cover loss if photos or footage of them ends up anywhere that they don't belong. This doesn't apply to everything you'd pull through a shard with you, just the stuff that stands out.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T06:04:03-08:00","id":378956,"title":"","content":"...okay, I love Demon but I was never really sold on the whole &quot;alternate reality shards&quot; thing?<br /> <br /> I am now sold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T16:09:37-08:00","id":379591,"title":"","content":"Have any of you ever heard of Broken Rooms? Its an RPG game involving alternate worlds is a very science fiction horror style. I've heard it described as &quot;World of Darkness meets Sliders&quot; and I've found that description rather apt. The idea is that in 2002 reality split into 13 separate realities. Earth 1 is Earth as we know it, where nothing terribly noteworthy happened. Every other Earth went through some major disaster. <br /> <br /> Earth 2 all people vanished except folks who can move between Earths (due to a mutation in the hindbrain) and animal life and weather patterns are actively hostile to humanity in large groups. <br /> <br /> Earth 3 was smashed by a series of meteors ranging from the size of a buick to several miles wide (the largest piece hit the Sahara so hard it exposed the surface to the molten core of the planet and turned the Mediterrean into steam). The only saving grace is that the iron harvested from the meteors has qualities that work well against most of the things in the multiverse.<br /> <br /> Earth 4 had an alien invasion and humanity is still at war.<br /> <br /> Earth 5. 98% of the female population is suddenly unable to have children (their immune systems start treating pregnancy as if it is a foreign invader and killing the fetus almost immediately. The government has made efforts to round up all known women who can still conceive. The current story is that these women and their children will die a few months into pregnancy because of the same immune problem afflicting other women, but a few of them can (less than 1% of those in the remaining fertile population) will survive if they receive careful medical treatment. These mothers are treated like celebrities. A new TV reality series centers around them and their kids as they raise them, allowing a distraught and childless world to live vicariously through them. Unfortunately, this is all a lie. The other 99% of women are able to give birth just fine. And they do, constantly, fed chemicals to induce medical comas and fertility drugs to force them to give birth to as many children as possible. Of these children, females are put aside for future &quot;farming&quot;. A grim, grim world that's also full of abandoned toy stores and schools. Oh, and certain groups on the world who can jump to new realities have realized that only their Earth is afflicted by infertility and there are plenty of women out there...<br /> <br /> Earth 6- Something happened to the Sun. Its burning up its nuclear fuel at an accelerated rate. Its going to become a red giant in a few years now, which means its size will balloon large enough to swallow all the Inner planets including Earth. The governments are racing to build a series of &quot;Arcs&quot; to take select groups of humanity up into space before the end comes. Meanwhile, the Earth is now super hot. Getting caught out in the daytime without special goggles will blind you, and no special protection is an invitation for an instant sunburn and death by heatstroke (and possibly cancer) if you stay out. Humanity has largely moved underground and become nocturnal.<br /> <br /> Earth 7- Basically the opposite of Earth 6. A new ice age is underway, and humanity is facing a grim and cold death if a solution can't be found soon.<br /> <br /> Earth 8- A black hole is slowly passing through the Solar System. A series of violent Earthquakes due to &quot;gravity shockwaves&quot; rippling off the thing as it &quot;are Jupiter&quot; forced astronomers to explain the situation to the world. A Damocles (the clever name of the black hole) gets closer to inevitably swallowing the Earth government and infrastructure break down into chaos as humanity loses all hope.<br /> <br /> Earth 9- Nanotech is introduced to clean up the environment in the seas. Shockingly, things go wrong. The bots start killing human hosts, invading their bodies (mostly made up of water) and &quot;cleansing&quot; them of everything else. They managed to refine the process over time. Now only &quot;some&quot; of the body dies. The rest is taken over by the nanites and serves as a comfortable host for them. Basically, the world is now divided into military camps quarantining people and open areas filled with nanocorpses. Basically its The Last Of Us except with techno zombies rather than fungus.<br /> <br /> Earth 10- A weird aura borealis effect has begun sweeping over the Earth. Electronic devices no longer work, and looking at the pretty lights in the sky for too long makes you a little nutty. The world has regressed into a pseudo 1890s steam punk like world as people try to marry modern innovations to older forms of power. <br /> <br /> Earth 11- Things get weirder the further you go from Earth. Ghosts were confirmed on this world by science back in 2002. Now the world is one religion worshipping what it can confirm about the afterlife.<br /> <br /> Earth 12- Another even weirder one. This world is under constant siege by real yet invisible monsters. Only children are able to see them, and so kids have been recruited Ender's Game style to be the generals and last hope for humanity to fight against them. <br /> <br /> Earth 13- Called &quot;The Reef&quot; this world is unlike any of the others. There is no shared history (every other world was just like ours up until 2002). Instead, people finds accumulated &quot;pieces&quot; of debris of various kinds- alien styles of architecture, books no one every wrote, statutes of famous people who never existed...essentially evidence of even more realities out there. The going theory is that this world is the &quot;bottom&quot; of reality and that remnants of other realities end up in this world like debris caught on a Reef. Further into the reality are small towns on the edge of a vast shadowy wood. The towns each have a clocktower. Inside the clocktower is a pocket watch with the name of the reality jumper who finds it engraved on it. It gives you special powers. Going into the woods is dangerous. The world reacts to the minds of those inside it. The minds of the undisciplined (re- anyone who isn't native to the world and has not grown up having to constantly guard their thoughts) give birth to deadly creatures in the dark places.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T19:57:04-08:00","id":380705,"title":"","content":"I admit I stopped having any interest when I got to hideously unrealistic rape world. Like literally The Reef is more realistic than forced coma pregnancy Earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T06:24:09-08:00","id":380924,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the way Sliders did their &quot;most of one gender are sterile and/or dead&quot; world worked better than that.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what words to emphasize in that sentence...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[